  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Friendly Cities Extension - Women Friendly Cities Extension Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Women Friendly Cities Extension</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet &#xE4;r en f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngning under val&#xE5;ret 2014 av det p&#xE5;g&#xE5;ende Women Friendly Cities-programmet (53050018)vilket kontinuerligt syftar till att fr&#xE4;mja en gynnsam milj&#xF6; f&#xF6;r j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet genom att                j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsintegrera lokala myndigheters planeringsprocesser och    st&#xE4;rka dialogen med det civila samh&#xE4;llet. Lokala                      j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsmekanismer etableras i st&#xE4;der som ber&#xF6;rs av insatsen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The extention of the ongoing Women Friendly Cities programme          (53050018) continuosly aims at promoting an enabling environment for  women-friendly communities by means of mainstreaming gender into the  planning processes of local authorities and strengthening dialogue    with civil society. Local gender equality mechanisms are estalbished  in programme cities. Covering election year 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
